---
title: Strawberry Shortcake
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Desserts
cook time: 8-10 minutes
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@flour{2%cups}
@baking powder{3%tsp}
@butter{0.5%cup}
@rich milk or light cream{0.5%cup}
@sugar{2%Tbsp}
@salt{0.5%tsp}
@beaten egg{1}
@sweetened berries

Shift dry ingredients and cut in butter until mixture resembles course crumbs. Combine egg and cream. Combine mixtures, pat or roll to 1 inch. Cut and bake on ungreased baking sheet in very hot oven of 450 degrees for 8-10 minutes. Split pieces and spread with butter if desired. Spoon on sweetened berries. Serves 8.
